{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     Search object, grab it and perform specific task. If object not found, scan environment, wait for input.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Action ID = ScanEnvironment    /> <Action ID = PauseForInput    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
